# Git workflow

Work on a `feature/…` or `fix/…` branch off latest `dev`. Open PRs into **`dev`**, never `main`, unless Derek asks for a release.

Do not commit or push to `dev` or `main`. Do not close a PR and dump uncommitted files onto `dev`. Direct-to-`dev` only if Derek explicitly asks.

```
# BAD — commit on the working copy of the app
git checkout dev && git commit

# GOOD — side branch, then PR into dev
git checkout dev && git pull && git checkout -b feature/offline-cache
# …work, commit, push, PR targeting dev…
```
